# Registers this folder's singleton for the directory import (`import "commands"`),
# which is how it resolves when a debug build loads Main.qml from the source tree:
# a `pragma Singleton` file counts as a singleton only with a qmldir entry, and
# sibling non-singleton components are found without one. No `module` line — this
# must stay a plain directory. Mirror changes into QML_SINGLETONS in
# ../../CMakeLists.txt, which covers the compiled module.
singleton Verbs Verbs.qml
